body: "Issue 339: distinguish observable section-local reorders from exact previous-renderer output and tracker changes. Preserve check exit 1, carry rendering revisions in receipts, and emit a safe regeneration invocation for generator drift. Restore the missed 2026.11.7 operator action through the native tracker catalog and reconcile delivered historical items. The shared previous renderer controls dependency selection, Markdown heading recognition, whitespace and prepend cleanup."
